oxygen (4:5.24.5-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.6.1, no changes required.
  * Remove inactive Uploaders.
  * Modernize building:
    - add the dh-sequence-kf5 build dependency to use the kf5 addon
      automatically
    - drop all the manually specified addons and buildsystem for dh
  * Drop the oxygen-sounds package, as it will be provided by its own source:
    - drop the oxygen-sounds binary
    - switch the oxygen-sounds requirement in plasma-theme-oxygen to a manually
      specified version
    - ignore the files previously in oxygen-sounds
  * Bump the libkdecorations2-dev to match the Plasma version.
  * Drop wrong Multi-Arch: same field from plasma-theme-oxygen, as it cannot be
    installed like that.

